  <metadata>
    <name>D14 Svolvær → Andøya → Andenes</name>
    <desc>221 km road, ≈4.0 h riding. Andøya National Tourist Route along the west coast (Bukkekjerka – Stave – Bleik). Short day – time for a whale safari from Andenes.</desc>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="69.3143" lon="16.1194">
